.TH DOUBLEPENDULUM 2
.SH NAME
doublependulum \- coupled nonlinear double-pendulum equations
.SH DESCRIPTION
The module evaluates derivatives for two massive pendulum links using absolute
link angles.  It accepts independent masses, lengths, gravity, and damping and
is suitable for interactive models or numerical experiments.
